msgid "All devices"
msgstr "全部设备"

msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "取消"

msgid "Connection"
msgstr "连接方式"

msgid "Daily (90 days)"
msgstr "每日（90天）"

msgid "Daily and monthly usage aggregated from the zen-traffic SQLite database. download = rx, upload = tx."
msgstr "查看设备每日和每月的上传、下载流量。"

msgid "Details"
msgstr "详情"

msgid "Device"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "Device Traffic"
msgstr "设备流量"

msgid "Device: "
msgstr "设备："

msgid "Download"
msgstr "下载"

msgid "Download rate"
msgstr "下载速率"

msgid "Download ↓"
msgstr "下载 ↓"

msgid "Edit hostname"
msgstr "修改主机名"

msgid "Failed to reset: %s"
msgstr "重置失败：%s"

msgid "Failed to set hostname: %s"
msgstr "修改主机名失败：%s"

msgid "IP"
msgstr "IP 地址"

msgid "Last activity"
msgstr "最后活动时间"

msgid "Monthly (12 months)"
msgstr "每月（12个月）"

msgid "No history data yet. Usage accumulates as traffic flows and is persisted on checkpoint/day rollover."
msgstr "暂无历史数据。有流量后会开始累计，并在定期保存或跨日时写入历史记录。"

msgid "Device rates and usage include internet and local traffic passing through the router. Internet-only upload and download shares are shown on the overview page."
msgstr "设备速率和用量包含经过路由器的互联网与局域网流量。仅互联网的上传、下载占比显示在概览页。"

msgid "Reset all counters for %s?"
msgstr "确定重置 %s 的全部流量统计？"

msgid "Reset counters"
msgstr "重置统计"

msgid "Router"
msgstr "路由器"

msgid "Save"
msgstr "保存"

msgid "The zen-traffic daemon is not reachable. History is stored in the daemon-side SQLite database."
msgstr "无法连接流量统计服务，请检查服务是否已启动。历史记录保存在该服务的数据库中。"

msgid "The zen-traffic daemon is not reachable. Install/enable the zen-traffic package, then verify with \"ubus call zen.traffic getStatus\" on the device."
msgstr "无法连接流量统计服务。请安装并启用 zen-traffic，然后在路由器上执行“ubus call zen.traffic getStatus”检查状态。"

msgid "This month"
msgstr "本月"

msgid "Today"
msgstr "今日"

msgid "Total"
msgstr "累计"

msgid "Traffic History"
msgstr "流量历史"

msgid "Upload"
msgstr "上传"

msgid "Upload rate"
msgstr "上传速率"

msgid "Upload ↑"
msgstr "上传 ↑"

msgid "Wi-Fi"
msgstr "无线"

msgid "Wired"
msgstr "有线"

msgid "Zen Traffic"
msgstr "Zen 流量"

msgid "Devices"
msgstr "设备"

msgid "History"
msgstr "历史"

msgid "%d seconds ago"
msgstr "%d秒前"

msgid "%d minutes ago"
msgstr "%d分钟前"

msgid "%d hours ago"
msgstr "%d小时前"

msgid "%d days ago"
msgstr "%d天前"

msgid "Realtime History"
msgstr "实时流量历史"

msgid "Last 5 minutes"
msgstr "最近5分钟"

msgid "Last hour"
msgstr "最近1小时"

msgid "Last 24 hours"
msgstr "最近24小时"

msgid "Last 7 days"
msgstr "最近7天"

msgid "Custom range"
msgstr "自定义范围"

msgid "Time range"
msgstr "时间范围"

msgid "Start time"
msgstr "开始时间"

msgid "End time"
msgstr "结束时间"

msgid "Query"
msgstr "查询"

msgid "Previous"
msgstr "上一页"

msgid "Next"
msgstr "下一页"

msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

msgid "Interface"
msgstr "接口"

msgid "Loading…"
msgstr "正在加载…"

msgid "WAN rates sampled every 5 seconds and retained for 7 days. Longer ranges show average rates."
msgstr "每5秒采集 WAN 上传、下载速率，保留最近7天。较长时间范围显示平均速率。"

msgid "Realtime history is unavailable. Update and enable the zen-traffic service."
msgstr "实时历史功能不可用，请更新并启用 zen-traffic 服务。"

msgid "Choose a valid time range within the last 7 days."
msgstr "请选择最近7天内有效的起止时间。"

msgid "Unable to query realtime history."
msgstr "查询实时历史失败，请检查服务状态后重试。"

msgid "Maximum displayed download"
msgstr "最高显示下载速率"

msgid "Maximum displayed upload"
msgstr "最高显示上传速率"

msgid "%d points · %d-second intervals"
msgstr "%d 个数据点 · 每%d秒一组"

msgid "No realtime history yet. Leave the service running to collect samples."
msgstr "所选范围暂无实时历史，请保持流量统计服务运行以采集数据。"

msgid "Independent scales"
msgstr "左右轴独立刻度"

msgid "Loading devices…"
msgstr "正在加载设备…"

msgid "No devices detected yet."
msgstr "暂未发现设备，产生流量后会出现在这里。"

msgid "%d devices · %d online"
msgstr "%d 台设备 · %d 台在线"

msgid "Online"
msgstr "在线"

msgid "Offline"
msgstr "离线"

msgid "Details for %s"
msgstr "查看 %s 的详情"

msgid "Internet download rate"
msgstr "互联网下载速率"

msgid "Internet upload rate"
msgstr "互联网上传速率"

msgid "Device usage today"
msgstr "今日设备用量"

msgid "Device usage this month"
msgstr "本月设备用量"

msgid "Device traffic is unavailable. Enable the traffic service and refresh this page."
msgstr "设备流量暂时不可用，请启用流量统计服务后刷新页面。"

msgid "Unable to refresh device traffic; showing the last result."
msgstr "暂时无法刷新设备流量，正在显示上次结果。"

msgid "Daily and monthly device usage, including internet and local traffic seen by the router."
msgstr "按日、按月查看设备用量，包含经过路由器采集的互联网与局域网流量。"

msgid "Hostname"
msgstr "主机名"

msgid "Loading history…"
msgstr "正在加载历史记录…"

msgid "Swipe or scroll to see more dates."
msgstr "左右滑动或滚动图表，查看更多日期。"

msgid "Unable to load history. Please try again."
msgstr "暂时无法加载历史记录，请重试。"

msgid "Traffic scope"
msgstr "统计范围"

msgid "Internet only"
msgstr "仅互联网"

msgid "Internet + local (existing history)"
msgstr "互联网＋局域网（原有历史）"

msgid "Reset selected device counters"
msgstr "清空所选设备的计数"

msgid "History analysis"
msgstr "历史分析"

msgid "Compare recorded usage by date and device, then inspect past internet rates. Current speeds are in Realtime monitoring."
msgstr "按日期和设备分析历史用量，也可查询过去的互联网速率。当前速度请看“实时监控”。"

msgid "Device usage ranking"
msgstr "设备用量排名"

msgid "Internet-only daily records start when this version is installed and retain 90 days. Monthly bars sum these retained days. Older mixed records cannot be converted."
msgstr "每日互联网用量从本版本启用时开始记录，保留 90 天；月柱汇总这些已保留的日期。旧的混合用量不能转换。"

msgid "Existing history includes internet and local transfers: 90 days of daily records and 12 months of monthly records."
msgstr "原有历史包含互联网和局域网传输：每日记录保留 90 天，每月记录保留 12 个月。"

msgid "Unable to reset device counters."
msgstr "无法清空设备计数，请重试。"

msgid "Recorded upload"
msgstr "所选记录上传"

msgid "Recorded download"
msgstr "所选记录下载"

msgid "Choose Internet only to compare devices with the upstream total."
msgstr "选择“仅互联网”，即可将设备用量与上游总量比较。"

msgid "Ranking covers the same retained 90-day internet window. Percentages use the upstream total; unassigned traffic is shown separately."
msgstr "排名汇总同一份已保留的 90 天互联网记录。占比以上游总量为分母，未归属流量单独列出。"

msgid "Share"
msgstr "占比"

msgid "Unassigned"
msgstr "未归属流量"

msgid "Attributed device usage exceeds the upstream total; percentages may exceed 100%."
msgstr "设备归属用量超过了上游总量，占比可能超过 100%。"

msgid "Notification settings"
msgstr "通知设置"

msgid "Notification settings are unavailable. Update and enable the zen-traffic backend."
msgstr "通知设置暂不可用，请升级并启用 zen-traffic 后台。"

msgid "Enable automatic notifications"
msgstr "开启自动通知"

msgid "Send a daily report"
msgstr "每天推送流量报告"

msgid "Save notification settings"
msgstr "保存通知设置"

msgid "Choose where to receive internet usage alerts. A threshold alerts once per rule, channel and day. Daily reports show today’s usage up to your chosen time."
msgstr "选择接收互联网用量提醒的渠道。每条规则每天向每个渠道提醒一次；每日报告汇总当天截至推送时间的用量。"

msgid "Automatic notifications are off until you enable and save them."
msgstr "开启并保存后，自动通知才会生效。"

msgid "Feishu"
msgstr "飞书"

msgid "WeCom"
msgstr "企业微信"

msgid "Daily usage threshold alerts"
msgstr "今日用量超限提醒"

msgid "Watch the whole network or a chosen device. Only internet uploads and downloads count; local transfers do not."
msgstr "可监控整个网络或指定设备，只计算互联网上传、下载，不计算局域网传输。"

msgid "Add threshold rule"
msgstr "添加提醒规则"

msgid "Daily report"
msgstr "每日流量报告"

msgid "Send time (router local time)"
msgstr "推送时间（路由器本地时间）"

msgid "Includes the network’s upload and download totals and the top five devices. If the router restarts after the chosen time, it sends the missed report once that day."
msgstr "报告包含全网上传、下载，以及用量前五的设备。路由器在推送时间之后重启时，会补发当天尚未发送的报告。"

msgid "The first day starts when this version is installed and may be incomplete. Older mixed history is not used for alerts."
msgstr "启用首日可能不足一整天；提醒不会使用旧的混合流量历史。"

msgid "Saving applies immediately; collection does not restart."
msgstr "保存立即生效，流量采集不会重启。"

msgid "Recent deliveries"
msgstr "最近发送记录"

msgid "Use this channel"
msgstr "启用此渠道"

msgid "Saved · leave blank to keep"
msgstr "已保存 · 留空保留原值"

msgid "Paste your bot webhook URL"
msgstr "粘贴机器人的 Webhook 地址"

msgid "Optional signing secret"
msgstr "可选：签名密钥"

msgid "Send test message"
msgstr "发送测试消息"

msgid "Bot webhook URL"
msgstr "机器人 Webhook 地址"

msgid "Add a custom bot in your Feishu group, then copy its webhook URL."
msgstr "在飞书群里添加自定义机器人，然后复制 Webhook 地址。"

msgid "Add a message-push bot in your WeCom group, then copy its webhook URL."
msgstr "在企业微信群里添加消息推送机器人，然后复制 Webhook 地址。"

msgid "Signing secret"
msgstr "签名密钥"

msgid "Required if the Feishu bot uses signature verification. Enter a dash to clear a saved secret."
msgstr "飞书机器人开启签名校验时需填写；输入 - 可清除原签名密钥。"

msgid "If your bot requires a keyword, allow “Zen”."
msgstr "如果机器人要求关键词，请将“Zen”加入允许列表。"

msgid "Bot setup guide"
msgstr "机器人设置指南"

msgid "Enable rule"
msgstr "启用规则"

msgid "Whole network"
msgstr "整个网络"

msgid "Total usage"
msgstr "上传＋下载"

msgid "Threshold unit"
msgstr "提醒用量单位"

msgid "Threshold amount"
msgstr "提醒用量数值"

msgid "Monitor"
msgstr "监控范围"

msgid "Today’s"
msgstr "今日累计"

msgid "Alert at"
msgstr "达到此值提醒"

msgid "Remove"
msgstr "删除"

msgid "Choose a valid report time."
msgstr "请选择有效的报告推送时间。"

msgid "Enter a positive threshold no larger than 1 PiB."
msgstr "提醒用量必须大于零且不超过 1 PiB。"

msgid "Notification settings saved."
msgstr "通知设置已保存。"

msgid "Unable to save notification settings."
msgstr "无法保存通知设置。"

msgid "Save your changes before sending a test."
msgstr "请先保存修改，再发送测试消息。"

msgid "Test queued. Check Recent deliveries for the result."
msgstr "测试已加入发送队列，请在“最近发送记录”查看结果。"

msgid "Unable to queue test message."
msgstr "无法加入测试消息。"

msgid "Queued"
msgstr "等待发送"

msgid "Sending"
msgstr "正在发送"

msgid "Retry pending"
msgstr "等待重试"

msgid "Sent"
msgstr "已发送"

msgid "Failed"
msgstr "发送失败"

msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

msgid "Threshold alert"
msgstr "超限提醒"

msgid "Connection test"
msgstr "连接测试"

msgid "No messages sent yet. Save a channel and send a test to check it."
msgstr "暂无发送记录。保存渠道后，可发送测试消息检查连接。"

msgid "Channel"
msgstr "渠道"

msgid "Message"
msgstr "消息类型"

msgid "Status"
msgstr "状态"

msgid "Past internet rates"
msgstr "过去的互联网速率"

msgid "Realtime monitoring"
msgstr "实时监控"

msgid "See who is using the network now. Current rates and the last five minutes appear here; usage totals and past dates are in History analysis."
msgstr "查看现在谁在用网，显示当前速度和最近五分钟趋势。累计用量和过去日期请看“历史分析”。"

msgid "Internet rates · last 5 minutes"
msgstr "互联网速度 · 最近 5 分钟"

msgid "Upload is orange; download is green. Each direction has its own scale."
msgstr "橙色为上传，绿色为下载；上传、下载使用各自的纵轴。"

msgid "Devices · internet rates"
msgstr "设备 · 当前互联网速度"

msgid "Online devices"
msgstr "在线设备"

msgid "Local transfer rate"
msgstr "当前局域网传输速度"

msgid "View usage history"
msgstr "查看用量历史"
